{
  "title": "Ordered systolic decline did not establish added albuminuria prediction across NHANES cycles",
  "abstract": "Adding first-to-third systolic BP decline to a conventional model trained in 5,022 NHANES 2009\u20132010 adults changed weighted albuminuria-prediction Brier score in 4,719 NHANES 2015\u20132016 adults by \u22120.00000599 (conditional survey-bootstrap 95% interval \u22120.00002424 to +0.00001085). The prespecified improvement criterion failed. This separate-cycle test does not establish independent-study validation, clinical utility, equivalence, or causation.",
